// THE DRACONIC VISAGE AND THE DRAGONFIRE SHIELD (Corey, 2026-10-09).
//
// IMPORTED FROM THE REV 474 CACHE, which is the period source rather than a convenience: both were
// released on 18 June 2007 in "The Dragonfire Shield" update, and the 474 cache is 27 October 2007,
// so it holds the originals at Old School's own ids (visage 11286, shield 11283 charged and 11284
// uncharged). Models copied byte-for-byte by tools/models/import474.py.
//
// THE TWO SHIELDS SHARE A MODEL, and that is the cache's own answer, not an oversight: 11283 and
// 11284 both point at model 26457 and manwear 26423. Old School only darkened the uncharged one on
// 9 November 2017, ten years later, so in 2007 art they are the same shield.
//
// STATS ARE OLD SCHOOL'S. Attack -10 magic, -5 ranged, nothing else; defence 20/25/22 melee, 10
// magic, 22 ranged; strength +7. The CHARGED one carries the same numbers here and gains its
// +1 per charge at runtime, because 51 obj records for 51 charge counts is not a design - see
// ~dfs_charge_defence in the script, which equip.rs2 adds the way it already adds the blowpipe's
// loaded dart.
//
// WHICH IS WHY THERE ARE STILL TWO RECORDS. The charges live on the PLAYER, as the blowpipe's and
// the trident's do (an obj here carries no per-item state), so the charged shield has to be
// untradeable or charges would travel with a trade. Uncharged is the tradeable one, exactly as in
// Old School - "the shield can only be traded when uncharged" - and that is the same reason the
// blowpipe splits in two.
//
// param=antidragon IS THE IMPORTANT LINE. Eleven places in this codebase used to ask
// `inv_total(worn, antidragonbreathshield) > 0` by name, and a dragonfire shield that did not
// answer them would be the best shield in the game and set you on fire. They ask
// ~has_antidragon_shield now, which reads this param off whatever is in the hand slot.

[draconic_visage]
name=Draconic visage
desc=This looks pretty rare.
model=obj_draconic_visage
2dxof=-5
2dyof=-5
2dzoom=1697
2dxan=567
2dyan=152
2dzan=2047
cost=750000
members=yes
weight=1500g

[dragonfire_shield_uncharged]
name=Dragonfire shield
desc=A shield made from the visage of a dragon.
model=obj_dragonfire_shield
manwear=obj_dragonfire_shield_manwear,0
womanwear=obj_dragonfire_shield_manwear,6
2dzoom=2022
2dxan=540
2dyan=123
iop2=Wear
wearpos=lefthand
cost=2000000
members=yes
weight=12lb
category=armour_shield
param=magicattack,-10
param=rangeattack,-5
param=stabdefence,20
param=slashdefence,25
param=crushdefence,22
param=magicdefence,10
param=rangedefence,22
param=strengthbonus,7
param=defend_anim,human_shield_defence
param=antidragon,yes

